    "active": true,
    "description": "<blockquote><p>Prerequisite: Level 2+ Warlock, a Warlock Cantrip That Deals Damage</p></blockquote><p>Choose one of your known Warlock cantrips that deals damage and has a range of 10+ feet. When you cast that spell, its range increases by a number of feet equal to 30 times your Warlock level.</p><p><strong>Repeatable.</strong> You can gain this invocation more than once. Each time you do so, choose a different eligible cantrip.</p><section id=\"secret-7hr3xIfya7IOq7pj\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use the <strong>Increase Range</strong> enchantment activity and drag your chosen cantrip to the chat card to increase its range and append \", Eldritch Spear\" for easier identification.</p></section>",
